From e5fcf5886070cd098da118b46fe3fed0738370ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 00:38:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): ribbon labels whole at 1280 px, group captions
 painted again

Cell labels shrink to fit (13 -> 10 px) before eliding; the four section
doors wear short words (Mill 2D, Mill 3D, Drill, Multi) so they no longer
all read "Milli..."; group captions are painted again where they fit their
group. The ground grid returns nothing for a non-finite or absurd camera
(dist 1e308 made its line range span all of i64).

Fixes #948

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
